# Luminary marker — cli#254 Batch A drives
- date: 2026-09-26
- branch: feat/254-batch-a-drives
- lead: john-ousterhout
- supporting: [david-parnas, michael-feathers]
- rationale:
  - lead (Ousterhout) — one deep module (generic driver + catalog)
    replaces 7 near-identical files. Interface (SKILL_NAME arg + env
    overrides) narrower than 7 separate files.
  - supporting (Parnas) — information hiding. Skills reference the
    driver by SKILL_NAME. Adding/changing patterns per skill is a
    catalog edit; consumers don't touch driver code.
  - supporting (Feathers) — same fake_claude fixture pins actual
    behavior. Iterated tests fire per skill in the catalog.
